{"id":"yimatong-cdr","title":"重构 service 层 commit 为 flush 避免 RLS 失效","description":"service 层函数内部调用 db.commit() 会结束事务导致 SET LOCAL app.tenant_id 失效，后续查询无 RLS 保护。需将所有 service 层 commit 改为 flush，由 get_db 统一管理事务边界。影响文件: backend/app/services/code.py 及其他 service。","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"pickgun4life","owner":"ericding@yeah.net","created_at":"2026-05-29T13:22:32Z","created_by":"pickgun4life","updated_at":"2026-05-29T13:40:01Z","started_at":"2026-05-29T13:33:40Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T13:40:01Z","close_reason":"Closed","labels":["architecture","security"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
